<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">1 Teselonk'e</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Teselonk'e</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Teselonk'e Ashwots Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Shints Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">Teselonk'e Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Teselonk'e Mek'odoniya eteets Rom shiritsi een kittuniye b teshi, P'awlos Teselonk'e Ik' moowu b́ need'i Filip'siyosi k'azk'rat b́ amiyakone, wotowa eree Ayhudi hayimanotiyo dek'osh t'int teshts Ik'i ash woterawwots P'awlos b́ t'intsiru Krstni woshon getseyat boteshtsosh ayhudiyots okoort P'awlosats fayo tuuztni bo teshi, manshowere P'awlos Teselonk'eyi fakshr Beriyo maants bíamo ooro b́falawok'o wot b́wtsi, ja'atnwere K'orontosits am b́ bodtsok'on bíyats karnt bín tep'f teshtso T'imotiwos Teselonk'e maants amt b́ aantsok'on Ik' mootse beyiru keewo ik ikon bísh b́ dani.</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos b́ wosh shintso Teselonk'e ashuwotssh b́ guut' Krstiyaniwotsi kup'iyosha b́teshi, bo imnetiyona et bo shuni jango sheeng keewo b́ shishtsosh Ik'o b́ udi, P'awlos bo taalotse b́ datseyor awuk'o beyo b́ beetsok'o itsh gawituwe, maniyere okono Krstos aanar weyi jangosh aatets aatosh aaniyo b́ imi, aatetsanotsitsere k'atsuwots.</para>
  <para style="ip">«Krstos aani b́ wooniyere shinon amanat k'irtso Krstos aani b́ woor b́ daatsitdúre dúr beyoke kaydek'etuwo wotituwe? Krstos awure aanar b́ weeti?» etiruwotsiye, P'awlos manatse tuut «Krstos aani b́weyi dano tewunon korfetsr manoor b́ borfetsosh it fino finore» ett boon b́ iziri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1</para>
  <para style="io1">P'awlos gene'úwonat udon 1:2—3:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyani beyosh wotituwo 4:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos aani b́ weyi jango daniyets dano 4:13—5:11</para>
  <para style="io1">S'uwaatsi izets izo 5:12-22</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 5:23-28</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1"/>
  <para style="s">Jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:1">Wosh. 17:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Ik'o nihonat doonzo Iyesus Krstos jirwotsi wottsuwots Teselonk'e Ik'i maa ashuwotssh, P'awulosoke, Silasnat T'imotiwosoke wosheets woshoniye, s'aatonat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="1TH 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Teselonk'e ashuwots beyonat imnetiyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2"/>Noo úni aawo Ik'o nok'onoor itn gawufetsat Ik'osh údo t'intsiruwone. <verse eid="1TH 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3"/>Noo Ik'o Izar Izewernat nonih shinatse it imnetiyo b́ finiruwo, shunosh it k'aliruwonat nodoonz Iyesus Krstosn it detstso jangat k'amoon it kotiruwo no need'irawon gawiruwone. <verse eid="1TH 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4"/>Shuneets eshuwwotso! Ik'o iti galb́dek'tsok'owo danfone. <verse eid="1TH 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5"/>Doo shishiyo itsh noshishiy noon keewu mec'ron b́woterawon angonat shayiri S'ayinone, dooshishiyo ariko b́wottsok'owo danfetsatniye, itnton noteshor itsha etaat awuk'o nobeetsok'o danfte. <verse eid="1TH 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:5-9">Wosh. 17:5-9</ref> </char></note> Ay gond bek'o itats b́ bodaloru dab S'ayin shayironton daatseyiru gene'onton b́ aap'o dek'at noonat no doonz Iyesusi sheengon artswotsi woterte. <verse eid="1TH 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7"/>Mansh Mek'odoniyonat Akayiyon beyiru amants jamwotssh sheengon ariyetswotsi wotertee. <verse eid="1TH 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8"/>It nabts doonzo aap'o b́ shishe Mek'odoniyonat Akayiy mec'ron b́ woterawo Ik'atse it detsts imnetiyo jam beyok danere b́ teshi, han jangosh noo eegoru keewo noon geyiratse. <verse eid="1TH 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9"/>Itok nowoor awuk'o noon it dek'tsok'o arikon beyat beyirwo Izar Izewersh finosh woteraw ik'atsere galeyat awuk'on Ik'o maants it aantsok'o ashmanots botookon gawitune. <verse eid="1TH 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10"/>Mank'o Krstosi k'irotse tiztso, weet fayotse noon fariyituwo, b́ naayi Iyesusi daaratse b́woo awuk'on it kotetuwok'o gawitune.<verse eid="1TH 1:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2"/>
  <para style="s">P'awlos woshetsi fino Tesolonk'eyitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1"/>Ti eshuwotso! no it maants nowoo shuwalo b́teyawok'o it it tookon danfte. <verse eid="1TH 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-24">Wosh. 16:19-24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:1-9">17:1-9</ref> </char></note> It itdantsok'o haniyereshin Filipisyositse no teshor gond bek'onat c'ashon noats bodre, ernmó een wotts k'efo noats b́ bodaloru dab Ik'i dooshishiyo itsh nobetsitwok'o Izar Izewer noosh ááwu shuuk'o imre. <verse eid="1TH 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3"/>Noo iti noiztso dáron wee kim keewon jiisheyatniyaaliye, iti dariyosh nok'alts keewo eegonwor aaliye. <verse eid="1TH 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4"/>Maniyere dab Ik'o noosh dooshishiyan adaron noon amanat b́imtsotse keewituwone, manowere nok'alir nonib s'iliru Ik'o gene'ushosha bako asho gene'ushosh etniyaliye. <verse eid="1TH 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5"/>Iknotunoru dáshon wee gizi shunon detsetwo no keewawok'o b́ jamon it it tookon danfte, Ik'onu noosh gawe. <verse eid="1TH 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6"/>Itoke wotowa k'osh asho konoknoru mango geeratsone. <verse eid="1TH 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7"/>Krstossh woshetswotsi no wottsok'on noosh geyitwo itoke aatosh falfone b́ teshi, ernmó indu b nana'o b maants bdetsfok'on maac' nefon it dagotse no anaani. <verse eid="1TH 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8"/>Eshe ayidek'at itn noshuntsatse tuutson doo shishiyo itsh ím mec'ro b́ woterawo nokashonoru dab itsh no shunon imosh k'andek'k noone. <verse eid="1TH 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9"/>Ti eshuwotso! awuk'o no fintsok'onat shaatstsok'o gawo falfte, Ik' doo shishiyo itsh no nabor ik doonzatsoru kuro nowoterawok'owa etaat t'uwe aawo finone nomawufoni.<verse eid="1TH 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10"/>Amantsuwots dagots itnton nobeyor awuk'o s'ayinonat aawk'o kááw eeg eeg deshaw beyon nobefok'osh it noosh gaw itne, Ik'onuwere noosh gawe, <verse eid="1TH 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11"/>niho b́ nana'uwotssh b́ k'alfok'o noowere itsh ik ikon nok'altsok'o danfte, <verse eid="1TH 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12"/>jam aawo itn izon kup'efetsat b́ mengstonat b́ mango it kayituwok'o itn s'eegtso Izar Izewer b́ geene'úituwok'o it beyish oona itsha, no ettsok'o danfte.<verse eid="1TH 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13"/>Dabnu it jangosh noneed'rawo Ik'o no udiru weero detsfone, bíwere nooke it shishtso Ik' aap'o it dek'tsok'on itoke amantsuwotsoke finit aap'an it dek' ash aap'tsok'o b́ woterawo ari Ik' aaop'tsok'o woshdek'atniye, arikon Ik' aap'e. <verse eid="1TH 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 17:5">Wosh. 17:5</ref> </char></note> Ti eshuwotso, it Yhud datsatse faúwots Krstos Iyesusn Ik' maa wottsuwotsitse sheengwotsi wottsuwots jafro shoyerte, boowere ayhudiyotsn gond bek'o boats b́ bodtsok'o jamon itwere it took jirwotsoke gond bek'o itats bodre. <verse eid="1TH 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 9:23">Wosh. 9:23</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:45">13:45</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:2">14:2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 14:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 17:5">17:5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 17:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:12">18:12</ref> </char></note> ayhudiyots doonzo Iyesusnat nebiyatiyotsi bo úd'tsok'o nonowere giishdek't datsatsere noon kishtsuwotsiye, boowere Ik' shiyanirwotsnat ash jamo shit'irwotsiye, <verse eid="1TH 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16"/>Ik' ash woterawwots bín bokashit aap'o t keewawok'o dab bobaziyiri, hank'on morro morrats dabfere boamiri, mansh s'uwatsere Ik' fayo boats waare.<verse eid="1TH 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos aani Tesolok'e ashuwotsi s'ilosh b́detsts tewuno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17"/>Ernmó ti eshuwotso! shayiron b́ woterawo meetson múk' gizewosh itatsere no k'aletsosh itsh t detsts mirac'o ay b́ wottsotse ti ááwon itn bek'osh ayidek'at geere b́ teshi. <verse eid="1TH 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18"/>Mansh it maants wosh geyatni notesh, bítsnowere taa P'awlos it maants wosh anaani geyere b́teshi, ernmó Shed'ano noon b́baziyi. <verse eid="1TH 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19"/>Bere, nojangiruwo wee nogeneeúwo wee nodoonz Iyesus b́woor b́shinaatse no it'etuwo no da'atsi mangi jip'uwots (akliliwots) itna bako kone? <verse eid="1TH 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20"/>Arikon nomanguwotsnat nogeneeúwotsuwots itne.<verse eid="1TH 2:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:15">Wosh. 17:15</ref> </char>
    </note> Mansh eshe haniyere okoon k'amdek'o nomaawtsotse Ateni eteets kitots noaali ooro noosh sheeng araatniye b́ be'eyi. <verse eid="1TH 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2"/>No eshu Ik'i guuts wottso, Krstosko sheeng doo shishiyon finon no tooho T'imotiyosi itsh wosherone, itsh no woshuwere iti b́kup'shr imnetiyon it kup'ituwok'o itn b́ izituwok'owe, <verse eid="1TH 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3"/>Hanuwere it ats bodts gond bek'atse tuutson it shek'eerawok'o iti woshituwe, gond bek'an noosh beezets gowo b́wottsok'owo it it tookon danfte. <verse eid="1TH 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4"/>Dabnwor itnton noteshor gondbek'o no ats b́bodetuwok'o shin shino keewfoone b́teshi, it dantsok'onowere gond bek'o noats bodre, <verse eid="1TH 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5"/>manatse tuutson k'amoon koto tmaawtsotse it amano danosh geeyat T'imotiwosi itok woshere, bín twoshwere daneraka fadfo iti ik weeron fadrek'úwa etaat, nofinonwere datsmec'ro wotat oorwtsere k'úwa etaat shatatniye.<verse eid="1TH 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:5">Wosh. 18:5</ref> </char>
    </note> Andmó T'imotiwos itoke nomaants waat it imnetiyi jangonat it shuni jangosh gene'úshit keewo noosh keewre, mank'owere úni aawo sheeng keewon noon it gawitwok'onat no iti bek'osh nomiraac'irwok'o itwere noon bek'osh it mirac'rwok'owo noosh b́keewi. <verse eid="1TH 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7"/>Eshe mansh eshuwotso, noo nodaatseyir kic'oonat gondbek'otse b́wotiyalor it imnetiyatse tuutson no ango kup'ere. <verse eid="1TH 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8"/>It doonzo Iyesusats kup'de'er itbeyo nooshowere man nok'alo noosh nobee. <verse eid="1TH 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9"/>Eshe and it jangosh udo t'intsirwone, it jangatse b́ shinatse nodetsts geneeúwosh Ik'o úditwone. <verse eid="1TH 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10"/>T'uwe aawo kup'sh dek'at Ik'o nok'onir nomeets ááwon iti be'er it amantsotse shaptso s'eentsosh tfalituwok'owe.<verse eid="1TH 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11"/>Andoor Izar Izewernat nonih b́tookon Iyesuswor it maants noweetwok'o noweero noosh kaatswe. <verse eid="1TH 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12"/>Noo iti noshunirwok'o doonzo it atsatseyonat jamoshor it detsts shuno eenr bí'ayituwok'o itsh woshuwe. <verse eid="1TH 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13"/>Mank'oon nodoonz Iyesus bik S'ayin jamwotsnton b́woor noko Izar Izewernat nonih shinatse it nibo eeg eeg deshawonat S'ayin b́wotituwok'o doonzo iti kup'shwe.<verse eid="1TH 3:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4"/>
  <para style="s">Ik'o geneúshit beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1"/>S'uwaatsnowere tí eshuwotso! Ik'o geneúshosh awuk'o beyo itsh b́geyituwok'owo no atse dandek'rte, andoor it beyir mank'owe, doonzo Iyesus shúútson iti nok'onirwonat iti noizirwere haniyere shini it k'aliruwoniyere bogo it finishe. <verse eid="1TH 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2"/>Doonzo Iyesus shúútson eeg arts bínjííshetso itsh no imtsok'o danfte. <verse eid="1TH 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3"/>Ik'i shuno it it s'ayinetwok'onat widatse it wokitwok'owe. <verse eid="1TH 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4"/>Ititse ik iketso b́máátsu S'ayinonat mangon korde'er detso dande'e. <verse eid="1TH 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5"/>Ik'o danawu Ik'i ash woteerawwotskok'o gusiyi tewuno b́deshawok'owa. <verse eid="1TH 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6"/>Keewanatse asho konuworu beshk'aye, amants k'oshono daadk'aye, haniyere shin itsh t keewutsok'onat tgawtsok'on keewanotsi k'alituwotsats doonzo boon sezituwe. <verse eid="1TH 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7"/>Ik'o noon b́ s'eeg s'ayinon nobetuwok'owa bako kimon no beyishaliye. <verse eid="1TH 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8"/>Eshe izets izan gac'ituwo, b́ gac'irwo S'ayin shayiro itsh imts Ik'oni bako ashaaliye.<verse eid="1TH 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9"/>It atsatsewo shuneyi jango it it tookon Ik'oke it dantsotse manjangosh konuwor itsh b́ guut'o geyiratse. <verse eid="1TH 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10"/>Mek'odoniyi s'eenotse fa'a eshú jamwotsi shunfte, b́ woteferoru ti eshuwotso, and itsh no izituwo bogshde'er it shuneetwok'o, <verse eid="1TH 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11"/>s'ker beyosh it kúp'ituwok'onat it took jangosh it gawitwok'o, haniyere shin itsh no azaztsok'o it kishon it finituwok'owe. <verse eid="1TH 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12"/>Mank'oon amaneraw ashuwotsoke sheeng beyo beetute, konatsoru te'etswotsi woteratste.<verse eid="1TH 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Doonzo aanar b́woor kashetswotsnat k'irtsuwots jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13"/>Ti eshúwotso! bo jangts deshaw ashuwotskok'o k'irts ashuwotssh it shiyanerawok'o aro it danetuwok'o shunfone. <verse eid="1TH 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14"/>Iyesus b́ k'irtsok'onat k'irotse b́ tuwtsok'o amanituwone, mansh Iyesusi amanat k'irtswots Ik'o bínton boon de'er weetuwe.<verse eid="1TH 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15"/>Doonzoke no dek'ts aap'ok'on itsh no keewitwo haniye, doonzo b́ wafetsosh kashon beyirwots k'irtsuwots shinats besheratsone. <verse eid="1TH 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16"/>Azazit k'ááro, melaki náásho k'ááro, Ik'i gááti k'aronuwere shishetuwe, doonzo b́tookonowere hanootsn jisheyar darotse oot'etwe, Krstosn amanat k'irtswotswere shin shino tuwitune. <verse eid="1TH 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 15:51-52">1 K'or. 15:51-52</ref> </char></note> Maniyere il noo kashon fa'úwots doonzonton jongats gonkewosh bonton daawnon dambaan k'awu'etuwe, dúre dúrosh doonzonton wotitwone. <verse eid="1TH 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18"/>Mansh eshe aap'ets aap'an it atsatseyo iko iko kup'shwere.<verse eid="1TH 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5"/>
  <para style="s">Doonzo woo k'ande'er korere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1"/>Ti eshuwotso! keewan b́ wotit́ dúronat b́ gizewosh eegoru itsh guut'o geyiratse. <verse eid="1TH 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 24:43">Mat. 24:43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:39">Luk'. 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:10">1 P'et'. 3:10</ref> </char></note> Doonzo b́ weet aawo úmp'etso t'úwon b́ wafok'o b́ wottsotse it it tookon sheengshde'k'at danfte. <verse eid="1TH 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3"/>Ashuwots «Keew jamó jeenonat s'k erkee» bo etor na'a maac'ts máátsuwats na'a shuwi shambo bin b́detsfok'o t'afo danerawo boats b́ weeti, eegi weeronoru bítse keshosh falatsne. <verse eid="1TH 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4"/>Ti eshuwotso itmó, t'aluwots itnaliye, mansh aaw man ump'etsok'o itats waratse. <verse eid="1TH 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5"/>It it únets shááni ashuwots, aawi ashuwots itne, nooye wee t'úwi wee t'alwi ashuwots noonaliye. <verse eid="1TH 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6"/>Mansh eshe no tooko kewde beewone bako k'oshwotskok'o tokrk'ayone. <verse eid="1TH 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7"/>Tokriru ashuwots t'úwone botokriri, mashiruwotswere t'úwone bomashiri. <verse eid="1TH 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 59:17">Isa. 59:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:13-17">Efe. 6:13-17</ref> </char></note> Noomó aawi ashuwotsi nowottsotse notooko keewon no angok'on beewone, imnetiyonat shunon t'ururiyok'o nogerats tahde'oone, kashosh jangetso kes'tswots boatse baziyosh bogúúfef k'obiyok'o tookats guufde'one, <verse eid="1TH 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9"/>Ik'o noon b́ s'eeg fayosh b́woterawon nodoonz Iyesus Krstos weeron no kashishee. <verse eid="1TH 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10"/>Krstos no jangosh b́k'ir kashon nobeyal wee nok'iriyal bínton nobeyishe. <verse eid="1TH 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11"/>Mansh and it k'alirwok'on iko iko kup'shon t'engde'e.<verse eid="1TH 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi izonat jamon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12"/>Eshuwotso! ititse finon shaatsirwotsi, doonzon it naashwotsnat iti iziruwotsi it mangiyituwok'o itn k'oniruwoone, <verse eid="1TH 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13"/>Bo finatse tuutson boosh eents manogonat shunon it detsetwok'owa, itwere it atsatsewo jeenon beewere.<verse eid="1TH 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14"/>Eshuwotso! «Wihuwotsi fayore, aaw shuuk' deshawwotsi kúp'shwere, maawtswotsi te'uere, ash jamosh k'amoore» etaat gawiruwone. <verse eid="1TH 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15"/>Asho konworu gondi shegrosh gndon bí anirawok'o it atso korde'er, dab jam aawo it it took tookosh wotowa mank'o k'osh ashuwotssh k'osh ash jamwotssh sheeng finosh kup'ore.<verse eid="1TH 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16"/>Jam aawo gene'owere, <verse eid="1TH 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17"/>it eed'irawo Ik'o k'onwere, <verse eid="1TH 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18"/>jam keewon Ik'o udoore, Krstos Iyesusn it detsts beyon Ik'o itatse b́ geyirwo maniye.<verse eid="1TH 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19"/>S'ayin shayiri fino úp'k'ayere, <verse eid="1TH 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20"/>bek'o gac'k'ayere. <verse eid="1TH 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21"/>Jam keewo faduwere, sheeng wottso deshde'ere. <verse eid="1TH 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22"/>Gond fin jamatse wokoore.<verse eid="1TH 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23"/>B́ tookon jeeni Ik'o Izar Izewer jam keewon iti S'ayintsuwe, it Shayiro, it kasho, it ats jamo no doonz Iyesus Krstos b́ weet aawosh ik jagalo koteyar beewe. <verse eid="1TH 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24"/>Iti s'egtsmań amanek b́ wottsosh han k'alituwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25"/>Ti eshuwotso! nooshowere Ik'o k'onwere.<verse eid="1TH 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26"/>Eshúw jamwotsi S'ayints jobon jamo aatewere. <verse eid="1TH 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27"/>Woshan amants jamwotssh b́ nababetwok'o doonzo shútson oona itsh etetuwe.<verse eid="1TH 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28"/>No doonz Iyesus Krstos s'aato itnton wotowe.<verse eid="1TH 5:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5"/>
</usx>
